//@version=6
indicator("Adaptive Daily Scanner v2", "ADS2", overlay = true)

// ============================================================================
// ADAPTIVE DAILY SCANNER  v2.2.0  (2026-10-24)  — Pine Screener edition, 1D close
//
// LINEAGE
//   Portfolio Scanner v5 [CODEX] → Adaptive Swing Scanner v1.0 (4H, 2026-05-16)
//   → Adaptive Scanner Engine v3.0.0 (per-chart webhook engine, Sep 2026)
//   → THIS: screener-native, daily close, three horizon lanes scored in parallel.
//
// WHAT THIS IS
//   A Pine Screener indicator: every plot() is a column, every alertcondition()
//   is a boolean filter. It evaluates each symbol on the LAST CLOSED DAILY
//   CANDLE and scores three lanes:
//     SWING       2–8 weeks     S1 RSI mean-reversion, S4 multi-TF trend, S3 EMA momentum
//     POSITIONAL  3–12 months   S4 only (ASR Phase 3: POSITIONAL is S4-only by evidence)
//     GROWTH      1–3 years     trend template + 12-1 momentum + RS + fundamentals
//   It does NOT execute or emit webhooks. ASR v3 stays the execution engine;
//   this engine ranks a universe so the workup starts from a short list.
//
// INHERITED FROM ASR v3.0.0 (rules the validation harness selected)
//   • S1 fires on trigger AND its trend component >= 18 (above SMA200). No score gate.
//   • S3 fires on trigger with score >= 70 used as a RATE LIMITER (score is not predictive).
//   • S4 fires on trigger with score >= 75 (the one rubric whose score predicts outcome).
//   • Priority S1 > S4 > S3 by measured expectancy (+0.47 R, +0.21 R, +0.15 R).
//   • Long-only (every short trigger tested negative). No S2 Donchian (no edge).
//   • ADX x Choppiness x BBW regime is computed and EMITTED, never used as a gate.
//   • Weekly context = last CONFIRMED weekly bar (expr[1] + lookahead_on): no repaint.
//   • Stops: S1 1.2 ATR, S3 1.8 ATR, S4 2.5 ATR. POSITIONAL scales stop and target
//     by 2.75 / 1.5. R:R >= 1.5 enforced on mintick-rounded prices.
//   • Exit management (not in the screener, in the workup): S1 chandelier 3xATR +
//     time stop; S3/S4 50% at +1 R, breakeven, chandelier 3xATR, no time stop.
//
// NEW IN v2
//   • Closed-candle discipline: if the last daily bar is still forming when the
//     scan runs (time_close > timenow), every column reports the previous bar.
//   • GROWTH lane (the LONGTERM profile ASR deferred): Minervini-style trend
//     template, 12-1 momentum, RS vs benchmark, request.financial() revenue and
//     EPS growth. Hand-weighted and NOT validated — rank with it, forward-test
//     it, do not size on it. Entry triggers: pullback to rising 50D, 50D reclaim,
//     100-day base breakout on volume.
//   • Days-to-earnings (earnings.future_time) with a per-lane blackout.
//     VERIFIED 2026-10-23: the Pine Screener does NOT supply earnings.future_time
//     (Data OK bit 8 = 0 on every row, column blank), so inside the Screener the
//     blackout never blocks. It works on the chart. Apply the earnings check in
//     the pre-filter or the workup when you screen.
//   • Benchmark regime column (0 below 200D, 1 above, 2 above + rising 50D),
//     same encoding as Confluence Long Screener v3.
//   • v2.1: per-lane cooldown after a deploy (one signal per setup, as v1.0 had),
//     Entry / SL / TP reference lines and labels for the last deploy with a
//     dashed preview on the forming bar, one marker per bar (Horizon lane only),
//     and the v1.0 dashboard layout: strategy rows → lanes → winner → risk →
//     reference position → context. Lane status always names the gate that
//     blocked (e.g. "S4 70<75"), never a bare "no trigger" when S4 did trigger.
//   • v2.1.1: SCREENER ↔ CHART RECONCILIATION. The Screener cannot read the
//     earnings date, so a Screener "Horizon 1" row can be a chart "EARNINGS 6d"
//     block (DHI, 2026-10-23). The chart now draws that setup's Entry / SL / TP
//     in grey, dashed, labelled "NO DEPLOY: EARNINGS nd", and the WINNER row
//     says why it waits. Grey = the Screener row; coloured = a real deploy.
//   • v2.2.0 (after TradingView raised the Screener request limit 5 → 40 on
//     2026-10-23; probe script "ADS2 Probe" run in the Screener 2026-10-24):
//     - earnings.future_time is STILL not supplied in the Screener, not even
//       through request.security(). request.earnings() IS. So the next report is
//       now ESTIMATED from the reporting cadence (last report bar + the interval
//       that followed the same report a year earlier), with a cushion, and the
//       blackout uses the estimate when the exact date is missing. Columns:
//       "Days to Earnings" = exact, "Days to Earnings Est" = cadence estimate.
//     - Sector relative strength: syminfo.sector → SPDR sector ETF, RS 3M vs the
//       sector and the sector's own 50/200 trend. Columns + dashboard, no gate.
//       CHART ONLY: the Screener does not supply syminfo.sector either (verified
//       on version 8: Data OK bit 64 clear, Sector RS blank on every row), so
//       inside the Screener the sector falls back to the benchmark and the
//       column prints blank. Breadth, the earnings estimate and the quarterly
//       acceleration columns DO populate in the Screener.
//     - Breadth: INDEX:S5FI / S5TH (% of S&P 500 above 50D / 200D). Columns +
//       dashboard, no gate. Mkt Regime keeps the CLS v3 encoding.
//     - Quarterly acceleration: EPS / revenue FQ series → YoY growth of the last
//       three quarters, acceleration code (0-2) and the CAN SLIM "C" count
//       (quarters ≥ 25%). Columns + dashboard; optional growth gate, OFF.
//     Nothing new gates a deploy by default. Validate first, then gate.
//
// PINE SCREENER CONSTRAINTS HONOURED
//   • request.*() calls: weekly tuple (1) + benchmark (1) + financials 1Y (2) +
//     earnings (2) + sector ETF (1) + breadth (2) + financials FQ (2) = 11 of 40.
//   • 500-bar history: deepest lookback 252 + 14 (ATR percentile) < 500.
//   • input.symbol / input.timeframe are ignored by the screener → input.string.
//   • The first 10 plots are the default columns; plot order = decision order.
//   • Scan on 1D. Any other timeframe computes but is flagged (Data OK bit 16 = 0).
//   • Column titles avoid < and >: the Screener HTML-escapes them in headers.
//   • First S&P 500 scan (2026-10-23, 503 names): compiled clean, request.financial
//     populated, benchmark regime populated, 68 deploys (16 growth, 52 swing/S3).
//
// COLUMN CODES
//   Horizon     0 none · 1 SWING · 2 POSITIONAL · 3 GROWTH
//   Strategy    1 MR (S1) · 3 MOM (S3) · 4 MTF (S4) · 5 PB50 · 6 RECLAIM50 · 7 BASE100
//   Lanes bits  1 swing deploy · 2 positional deploy · 4 growth deploy
//   Data OK     1 warm-up done · 2 benchmark ok · 4 fundamentals ok · 8 earnings date ok · 16 chart is 1D
//               · 32 earnings date estimated from cadence · 64 sector ETF ok · 128 breadth ok
//   Regime      0 NEUTRAL · 1 MEAN_REV · 2 BREAKOUT · 3 MOMENTUM · 4 TRENDING (metadata only)
// ============================================================================

// ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
// ║ MASTER                                                                   ║
// ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
useClosedOnly = input.bool(true, "Closed-bar mode (report the last CLOSED daily candle)", display = display.none, group = "Master",
     tooltip = "ON: if the newest daily bar has not closed yet when the scan runs, every column is taken from the previous bar. OFF: the forming bar is scored as-is (intraday preview).")
benchSym      = input.string("AMEX:SPY", "Benchmark symbol (RS + market regime)", display = display.none, group = "Master",
     tooltip = "input.symbol is ignored by the Pine Screener, so this is a plain string. Use EXCHANGE:TICKER.")
minAdvM       = input.float(5.0, "Min 20-day avg dollar volume ($M)", display = display.none, minval = 0.0, maxval = 500.0, step = 1.0, group = "Master")
minPrice      = input.float(5.0, "Min price", display = display.none, minval = 0.0, step = 0.5, group = "Master")
minRR         = input.float(1.5, "Min R:R to deploy (swing & positional)", display = display.none, minval = 0.5, maxval = 5.0, step = 0.1, group = "Master",
     tooltip = "ASR default 1.5: catches degenerate geometry only, never vetoes a designed ratio.")
earnEstOn     = input.bool(true, "Earnings: estimate the next report from the reporting cadence when the date is unavailable", display = display.none, group = "Master",
     tooltip = "The Pine Screener never supplies earnings.future_time (verified again 2026-10-24, request wrappers included) but it does supply request.earnings(). The next report is projected as last report bar + the interval that followed the same report one year earlier. Error is a few days; the cushion below is added before the blackout test. An exact date always wins.")
earnEstCushion = input.int(3, "Earnings: cushion days added to the estimate", display = display.none, minval = 0, maxval = 10, group = "Master")

// ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
// ║ LANE GATES                                                               ║
// ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
sw_s1Gate     = input.float(18.0, "SWING · S1 trend-component gate", display = display.none, minval = 0.0, maxval = 25.0, step = 1.0, group = "Swing lane",
     tooltip = "18 = above SMA200; 25 = SMA50 > SMA200 as well. Replaces the regime gate that discarded 99.8% of S1's edge.")
sw_s3Gate     = input.float(70.0, "SWING · S3 score gate (rate limiter)", display = display.none, minval = 0.0, maxval = 95.0, step = 1.0, group = "Swing lane")
sw_s4Gate     = input.float(75.0, "SWING · S4 score gate (validated 70-75)", display = display.none, minval = 0.0, maxval = 95.0, step = 1.0, group = "Swing lane")
sw_earnDays   = input.int(7, "SWING · earnings blackout (days, 0 = off)", display = display.none, minval = 0, maxval = 30, group = "Swing lane",
     tooltip = "Block a swing deploy when the next earnings report is within N calendar days. Exact date on the chart; inside the Screener the cadence estimate (plus its cushion) is used; no date at all never blocks.")
sw_mktMin     = input.int(0, "SWING · min benchmark regime (0-2)", display = display.none, minval = 0, maxval = 2, group = "Swing lane",
     tooltip = "0 = no market gate (mean reversion does not want one). 1 = benchmark above its 200D. 2 = above 200D with rising 50D.")
sw_cool       = input.int(10, "SWING · cooldown bars after a deploy (0 = off)", display = display.none, minval = 0, maxval = 60, group = "Swing lane",
     tooltip = "One signal per setup. S3 stays true for up to 5 bars after a cross; without a cooldown the chart stacks a marker on each of them. 10 bars = two weeks. The Bars Since Deploy column still shows the age of the last signal.")

po_s4Gate     = input.float(75.0, "POSITIONAL · S4 score gate", display = display.none, minval = 0.0, maxval = 95.0, step = 1.0, group = "Positional lane")
po_stopMult   = input.float(2.75, "POSITIONAL · ATR stop multiple (ASR profile 2.75)", display = display.none, minval = 1.0, maxval = 6.0, step = 0.25, group = "Positional lane",
     tooltip = "ASR scales the S4 geometry by stopMult / 1.5: stop 2.5 ATR x 1.83 = 4.6 ATR, target 4.0 ATR x 1.83 = 7.3 ATR.")
po_minStruct  = input.int(3, "POSITIONAL · min structure count (0-5) to label horizon", display = display.none, minval = 0, maxval = 5, group = "Positional lane",
     tooltip = "Structure = weekly 20>50 EMA, SMA50 > SMA200, 200D rising, 12-1 momentum > 0, RS 6M > 0. Unvalidated: used to assign the horizon label, not to block the S4 deploy.")
po_earnDays   = input.int(0, "POSITIONAL · earnings blackout (days, 0 = off)", display = display.none, minval = 0, maxval = 30, group = "Positional lane")
po_mktMin     = input.int(1, "POSITIONAL · min benchmark regime (0-2)", display = display.none, minval = 0, maxval = 2, group = "Positional lane")
po_cool       = input.int(15, "POSITIONAL · cooldown bars after a deploy (0 = off)", display = display.none, minval = 0, maxval = 90, group = "Positional lane")

gr_gate       = input.float(70.0, "GROWTH · score gate (UNVALIDATED)", display = display.none, minval = 0.0, maxval = 95.0, step = 1.0, group = "Growth lane")
gr_revPeriod  = input.string("FQ", "GROWTH · revenue growth period", display = display.none, options = ["FQ", "FY", "TTM"], group = "Growth lane",
     tooltip = "REVENUE_ONE_YEAR_GROWTH. FQ = latest quarter YoY (acceleration), FY = last fiscal year, TTM = trailing twelve months.")
gr_epsPeriod  = input.string("FQ", "GROWTH · EPS growth period", display = display.none, options = ["FQ", "FY"], group = "Growth lane",
     tooltip = "EARNINGS_PER_SHARE_DILUTED_ONE_YEAR_GROWTH. TTM is not published for this id.")
gr_requireFund = input.bool(false, "GROWTH · require fundamentals present", display = display.none, group = "Growth lane",
     tooltip = "ON blocks the growth deploy when request.financial returns na (ETFs, some ADRs). OFF scores technicals only and leaves Data OK bit 4 clear.")
gr_maxRisk    = input.float(12.0, "GROWTH · max risk % to structural stop", display = display.none, minval = 3.0, maxval = 30.0, step = 0.5, group = "Growth lane",
     tooltip = "Stop = lower of (rising SMA50 - 1 ATR) and (10-day low - 0.25 ATR). If the distance exceeds this, the entry is too loose: wait for a tighter one.")
gr_earnDays   = input.int(0, "GROWTH · earnings blackout (days, 0 = off)", display = display.none, minval = 0, maxval = 30, group = "Growth lane")
gr_mktMin     = input.int(1, "GROWTH · min benchmark regime (0-2)", display = display.none, minval = 0, maxval = 2, group = "Growth lane")
gr_cool       = input.int(20, "GROWTH · cooldown bars after a deploy (0 = off)", display = display.none, minval = 0, maxval = 120, group = "Growth lane",
     tooltip = "A rising-50D touch can repeat for days while price rides the average. 20 bars = roughly one signal per month per name.")
gr_requireAccel = input.bool(false, "GROWTH · require EPS acceleration (accel code >= 1, UNVALIDATED)", display = display.none, group = "Growth lane",
     tooltip = "Quarterly EPS YoY growth rising versus the prior quarter (code 1) or the prior two (code 2). OFF by default: it is a column and a dashboard cell until forward-test data says it earns a gate.")

// ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
// ║ INDICATOR LENGTHS (ASR v3 defaults — daily bars)                         ║
// ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
adxLen        = input.int(14, "ADX Length", display = display.none, minval = 7, maxval = 30, group = "Regime (metadata)")
adxTrendThr   = input.int(25, "ADX Trending", display = display.none, minval = 15, maxval = 40, group = "Regime (metadata)")
adxRangeThr   = input.int(20, "ADX Range-Bound", display = display.none, minval = 10, maxval = 25, group = "Regime (metadata)")
chopLen       = input.int(14, "Choppiness Length", display = display.none, minval = 5, maxval = 30, group = "Regime (metadata)")
bbwLen        = input.int(20, "BB Width Length", display = display.none, minval = 10, maxval = 50, group = "Regime (metadata)")
bbwStd        = input.float(2.0, "BB Width StdDev", display = display.none, minval = 1.0, maxval = 3.0, step = 0.5, group = "Regime (metadata)")

s1_rsiLen     = input.int(14, "S1: RSI Length", display = display.none, minval = 2, maxval = 50, group = "S1 Mean Reversion")
s1_oversold   = input.int(30, "S1: Oversold", display = display.none, minval = 10, maxval = 45, group = "S1 Mean Reversion")
s1_supportLen = input.int(20, "S1: Support Lookback", display = display.none, minval = 5, maxval = 60, group = "S1 Mean Reversion")

s3_fastEMA    = input.int(9, "S3: Fast EMA", display = display.none, minval = 3, maxval = 30, group = "S3 EMA Momentum")
s3_slowEMA    = input.int(21, "S3: Slow EMA", display = display.none, minval = 10, maxval = 50, group = "S3 EMA Momentum")
s3_trendEMA   = input.int(50, "S3: Trend EMA", display = display.none, minval = 30, maxval = 200, group = "S3 EMA Momentum")
s3_macdFast   = input.int(12, "S3: MACD Fast", display = display.none, minval = 5, maxval = 20, group = "S3 EMA Momentum")
s3_macdSlow   = input.int(26, "S3: MACD Slow", display = display.none, minval = 15, maxval = 40, group = "S3 EMA Momentum")
s3_macdSig    = input.int(9, "S3: MACD Signal", display = display.none, minval = 3, maxval = 15, group = "S3 EMA Momentum")
s3_crossMax   = input.int(5, "S3: Max bars since cross", display = display.none, minval = 1, maxval = 20, group = "S3 EMA Momentum")

s4_wkFast     = input.int(20, "S4: Weekly Fast EMA", display = display.none, minval = 5, maxval = 50, group = "S4 Multi-TF Trend")
s4_wkSlow     = input.int(50, "S4: Weekly Slow EMA", display = display.none, minval = 20, maxval = 100, group = "S4 Multi-TF Trend")
s4_dailyEMA   = input.int(21, "S4: Daily Entry EMA", display = display.none, minval = 5, maxval = 50, group = "S4 Multi-TF Trend")
s4_rsiPBLo    = input.int(40, "S4: RSI Pullback Buy Zone", display = display.none, minval = 25, maxval = 50, group = "S4 Multi-TF Trend")

atrLen        = input.int(14, "ATR Length", display = display.none, minval = 5, maxval = 30, group = "Risk")

showLines     = input.bool(true, "Chart: SMA 50 / 150 / 200", display = display.none, group = "Display")
showLevels    = input.bool(true, "Chart: Entry / SL / TP lines for the last deploy", display = display.none, group = "Display",
     tooltip = "Reference levels of the last deploy, as v1.0 drew them. Cleared when the stop or the target is touched (growth: when close drops below the 200D). Reference only, never broker state.")
showPreview   = input.bool(true, "Chart: dashed preview while today's bar is still forming", display = display.none, group = "Display")
showBlocked   = input.bool(true, "Chart: grey levels for a setup blocked only by the earnings blackout", display = display.none, group = "Display",
     tooltip = "The Pine Screener cannot read earnings dates, so its Horizon > 0 rows include names the chart blocks on the blackout. Those levels are drawn in grey with the reason, so every Screener row has a visible explanation on the chart. Grey = screener row, coloured = real deploy.")
showShapes    = input.bool(true, "Chart: deploy markers", display = display.none, group = "Display")
showDash      = input.bool(true, "Chart: dashboard", display = display.none, group = "Display")
dashPos       = input.string("top_right", "Chart: dashboard position", display = display.none, options = ["top_right", "top_left", "middle_right", "middle_left", "bottom_right", "bottom_left"], group = "Display",
     tooltip = "Move it when another indicator's table (v1.0, CLS) already sits top-right.")
levelBars     = input.int(20, "Chart: level line length (bars)", display = display.none, minval = 5, maxval = 60, group = "Display")

// ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
// ║ CLOSED-BAR DISCIPLINE                                                    ║
// ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
// The Pine Screener scores a snapshot that may include today's partial bar.
// If that bar has not closed, report the previous bar and freeze lane state.
// On a live chart the bar's final (confirmed) update is never "forming", so the
// values that stick to a closed bar are its own.
forming  = time_close > timenow and not (barstate.isrealtime and barstate.isconfirmed)
off      = useClosedOnly and forming ? 1 : 0
updateOk = not (useClosedOnly and forming)
o(float x) => off == 1 ? x[1] : x
ob(bool x) => off == 1 ? x[1] : x

// ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
// ║ DAILY CONTEXT (chart = 1D, computed locally)                             ║
// ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
atr        = ta.atr(atrLen)
[diPlus, diMinus, adxVal] = ta.dmi(adxLen, adxLen)
rsi14      = ta.rsi(close, 14)
volSMA20   = ta.sma(volume, 20)
relVol     = volSMA20 > 0 ? volume / volSMA20 : na
rvPctile   = ta.percentrank(relVol, 50)
volAboveAvg = not na(volSMA20) and volume > volSMA20 * 1.15
advUsd     = volSMA20 * close

sma50      = ta.sma(close, 50)
sma150     = ta.sma(close, 150)
sma200     = ta.sma(close, 200)
hi52       = ta.highest(high, 252)
lo52       = ta.lowest(low, 252)
range52    = hi52 - lo52
distFromHi = range52 > 0 ? (hi52 - close) / range52 * 100.0 : na   // % of the 52-week range below the high (ASR semantic)
distFromLo = range52 > 0 ? (close - lo52) / range52 * 100.0 : na   // % of the 52-week range above the low
pctFromHi  = hi52 > 0 ? (close / hi52 - 1.0) * 100.0 : na            // negative = below the 52-week high
pctAboveLo = lo52 > 0 ? (close / lo52 - 1.0) * 100.0 : na
roc20      = close[20] > 0 ? (close / close[20] - 1.0) * 100.0 : na
roc60      = close[60] > 0 ? (close / close[60] - 1.0) * 100.0 : na
mom121     = close[252] > 0 and not na(close[21]) ? (close[21] / close[252] - 1.0) * 100.0 : na   // 12-1 momentum
atrPctile  = ta.percentrank(atr, 252)

// ── Benchmark: relative strength + market regime (request #1) ──────────────
bench      = request.security(benchSym, timeframe.period, close, ignore_invalid_symbol = true)
benchOk    = not na(bench)
benchSma50 = ta.sma(bench, 50)
benchSma200 = ta.sma(bench, 200)
mktRegime  = not benchOk or na(benchSma200) ? na : bench > benchSma200 ? (benchSma50 > benchSma50[10] ? 2.0 : 1.0) : 0.0
rs3m       = benchOk and close[63] > 0 and bench[63] > 0 ? ((close / close[63]) / (bench / bench[63]) - 1.0) * 100.0 : na
rs6m       = benchOk and close[126] > 0 and bench[126] > 0 ? ((close / close[126]) / (bench / bench[126]) - 1.0) * 100.0 : na

// ── Weekly context, last CONFIRMED weekly bar (request #2) ─────────────────
f_wk() =>
    _f = ta.ema(close, s4_wkFast)
    _s = ta.ema(close, s4_wkSlow)
    [_dp, _dm, _a] = ta.dmi(14, 14)
    [_f[1], _s[1], close[1], _a[1]]
wkTf = timeframe.in_seconds(timeframe.period) < timeframe.in_seconds("W") ? "W" : timeframe.period
[wkF, wkS, wkC, wkADX] = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, wkTf, f_wk(), lookahead = barmerge.lookahead_on)
wkBull = not na(wkF) and not na(wkS) and wkF > wkS and wkC > wkF

// ── Fundamentals (requests #3, #4) ─────────────────────────────────────────
revGrowth = request.financial(syminfo.tickerid, "REVENUE_ONE_YEAR_GROWTH", gr_revPeriod, ignore_invalid_symbol = true)
epsGrowth = request.financial(syminfo.tickerid, "EARNINGS_PER_SHARE_DILUTED_ONE_YEAR_GROWTH", gr_epsPeriod, ignore_invalid_symbol = true)
fundOk    = not na(revGrowth) and not na(epsGrowth)

// ── Quarterly acceleration (requests #5, #6; v2.2) ──────────────────────────
// FQ series step on each report. The n-th most recent distinct value is the
// n-th most recent quarter; YoY growth compares quarter n with quarter n+4.
epsQ = request.financial(syminfo.tickerid, "EARNINGS_PER_SHARE_DILUTED", "FQ", ignore_invalid_symbol = true)
revQ = request.financial(syminfo.tickerid, "TOTAL_REVENUE", "FQ", ignore_invalid_symbol = true)
f_qv(float s, simple int n) => ta.valuewhen(not na(s[1]) and s != s[1], s, n)
f_yoy(float a, float b) => na(a) or na(b) or b <= 0.0 ? na : (a / b - 1.0) * 100.0
epsQ0 = f_qv(epsQ, 0)
epsQ1 = f_qv(epsQ, 1)
epsQ2 = f_qv(epsQ, 2)
epsQ4 = f_qv(epsQ, 4)
epsQ5 = f_qv(epsQ, 5)
epsQ6 = f_qv(epsQ, 6)
revQ0 = f_qv(revQ, 0)
revQ1 = f_qv(revQ, 1)
revQ2 = f_qv(revQ, 2)
revQ4 = f_qv(revQ, 4)
revQ5 = f_qv(revQ, 5)
revQ6 = f_qv(revQ, 6)
epsG0 = f_yoy(epsQ0, epsQ4)
epsG1 = f_yoy(epsQ1, epsQ5)
epsG2 = f_yoy(epsQ2, epsQ6)
revG0 = f_yoy(revQ0, revQ4)
revG1 = f_yoy(revQ1, revQ5)
revG2 = f_yoy(revQ2, revQ6)
f_accel(float g0, float g1, float g2) => na(g0) or na(g1) ? na : g0 > g1 ? (na(g2) ? 1.0 : g1 > g2 ? 2.0 : 1.0) : 0.0
epsAccel = f_accel(epsG0, epsG1, epsG2)
revAccel = f_accel(revG0, revG1, revG2)
epsBigQ  = (nz(epsG0) >= 25.0 ? 1.0 : 0.0) + (nz(epsG1) >= 25.0 ? 1.0 : 0.0) + (nz(epsG2) >= 25.0 ? 1.0 : 0.0)   // CAN SLIM "C": quarters ≥ 25%
accelOk  = nz(epsAccel) >= 1.0

// ── Sector ETF: RS vs the symbol's own sector (request #7; v2.2) ───────────
// TradingView sectors (syminfo.sector) mapped to the SPDR that holds them.
// REITs sit in "Finance" here; Industrial Services holds oilfield services.
// CHART ONLY: the Pine Screener does not supply syminfo.sector (verified
// 2026-10-24), so there the switch falls to the benchmark and secOk is false.
secSym = switch syminfo.sector
    "Technology Services"    => "AMEX:XLK"
    "Electronic Technology"  => "AMEX:XLK"
    "Finance"                => "AMEX:XLF"
    "Health Technology"      => "AMEX:XLV"
    "Health Services"        => "AMEX:XLV"
    "Consumer Non-Durables"  => "AMEX:XLP"
    "Consumer Durables"      => "AMEX:XLY"
    "Consumer Services"      => "AMEX:XLY"
    "Retail Trade"           => "AMEX:XLY"
    "Producer Manufacturing" => "AMEX:XLI"
    "Industrial Services"    => "AMEX:XLI"
    "Transportation"         => "AMEX:XLI"
    "Commercial Services"    => "AMEX:XLI"
    "Distribution Services"  => "AMEX:XLI"
    "Energy Minerals"        => "AMEX:XLE"
    "Non-Energy Minerals"    => "AMEX:XLB"
    "Process Industries"     => "AMEX:XLB"
    "Utilities"              => "AMEX:XLU"
    "Communications"         => "AMEX:XLC"
    => benchSym
secClose  = request.security(secSym, timeframe.period, close, ignore_invalid_symbol = true)
secOk     = not na(secClose) and secSym != benchSym
secSma50  = ta.sma(secClose, 50)
secSma200 = ta.sma(secClose, 200)
secTrend  = not secOk or na(secSma200) ? na : secClose > secSma200 ? (secSma50 > secSma50[10] ? 2.0 : 1.0) : 0.0
rsSec3m   = secOk and close[63] > 0 and secClose[63] > 0 ? ((close / close[63]) / (secClose / secClose[63]) - 1.0) * 100.0 : na
secCode   = secSym == "AMEX:XLK" ? 1.0 : secSym == "AMEX:XLF" ? 2.0 : secSym == "AMEX:XLV" ? 3.0 : secSym == "AMEX:XLP" ? 4.0 : secSym == "AMEX:XLY" ? 5.0 : secSym == "AMEX:XLI" ? 6.0 : secSym == "AMEX:XLE" ? 7.0 : secSym == "AMEX:XLB" ? 8.0 : secSym == "AMEX:XLU" ? 9.0 : secSym == "AMEX:XLC" ? 10.0 : 0.0
secTag    = str.replace(secSym, "AMEX:", "", 0)

// ── Breadth: % of S&P 500 above its 50D / 200D (requests #8, #9; v2.2) ─────
s5fi = request.security("INDEX:S5FI", "1D", close, ignore_invalid_symbol = true)
s5th = request.security("INDEX:S5TH", "1D", close, ignore_invalid_symbol = true)
breadthOk = not na(s5fi) and not na(s5th)

// ── Earnings calendar (built-in + cadence estimate; requests #10, #11) ──────
// earnings.future_time is NOT supplied inside the Pine Screener, not even through
// a request.security() wrapper (probed 2026-10-24). request.earnings() IS, and
// its series steps on every report bar. So when the exact date is missing, the
// next report is projected: last report bar + the interval that followed the
// same report one year earlier (fallback: last interval, then 63 bars).
earnT = earnings.future_time
float daysToEarnExact = na(earnT) ? na : math.round((earnT - time_close) / 86400000.0)
earnKnown = not na(daysToEarnExact) and daysToEarnExact >= 0
eAct   = request.earnings(syminfo.tickerid, earnings.actual, ignore_invalid_symbol = true)
eStd   = request.earnings(syminfo.tickerid, earnings.standardized, ignore_invalid_symbol = true)
repBar = (not na(eAct[1]) and eAct != eAct[1]) or (not na(eStd[1]) and eStd != eStd[1])
int r0 = ta.valuewhen(repBar, bar_index, 0)
int r1 = ta.valuewhen(repBar, bar_index, 1)
int r3 = ta.valuewhen(repBar, bar_index, 3)
int r4 = ta.valuewhen(repBar, bar_index, 4)
float ivSeason = na(r3) or na(r4) ? na : r3 - r4
float ivLast   = na(r0) or na(r1) ? na : r0 - r1
float ivNext   = not na(ivSeason) and ivSeason >= 40 and ivSeason <= 90 ? ivSeason : not na(ivLast) and ivLast >= 40 and ivLast <= 90 ? ivLast : 63.0
float barsToEarnEst = na(r0) ? na : math.max(0.0, r0 + ivNext - bar_index)
float daysToEarnEst = na(barsToEarnEst) ? na : math.round(barsToEarnEst * 7.0 / 5.0)
earnEstKnown = earnEstOn and not earnKnown and not na(daysToEarnEst)
float daysToEarn = earnKnown ? daysToEarnExact : earnEstKnown ? daysToEarnEst : na
earnAnyKnown = earnKnown or earnEstKnown

// ── Warm-up ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
warmOk = bar_index >= 266 and not na(sma200) and not na(atrPctile) and not na(hi52) and not na(wkF) and not na(rvPctile)
isDailyTF = timeframe.isdaily and timeframe.multiplier == 1

// ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
// ║ REGIME DETECTION (ASR v3 verbatim — metadata, never a gate)              ║
// ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
chopATR = math.sum(ta.tr, chopLen)
chopHL  = ta.highest(high, chopLen) - ta.lowest(low, chopLen)
chop    = chopHL > 0 ? 100.0 * math.log10(chopATR / chopHL) / math.log10(chopLen) : na
[bbMid, bbUp, bbLo] = ta.bb(close, bbwLen, bbwStd)
bbw     = bbMid != 0 ? (bbUp - bbLo) / bbMid * 100.0 : na
bbwSMA  = ta.sma(bbw, 50)
bbwExpanding   = not na(bbwSMA) and bbw > bbwSMA * 1.1
bbwContracting = not na(bbwSMA) and bbw < bbwSMA * 0.9
atrSMA50     = ta.sma(atr, 50)
atrExpanding = not na(atrSMA50) and atr > atrSMA50 * 1.2
cChop = nz(chop, 50.0)
trendScore    = math.min((adxVal > adxTrendThr ? (adxVal - adxTrendThr) / 15.0 : 0.0) + (cChop < 38.2 ? (38.2 - cChop) / 20.0 : 0.0), 1.0) * 100.0
breakoutScore = math.min((atrExpanding ? 0.4 : 0.0) + (bbwExpanding ? 0.4 : 0.0) + (adxVal > adxRangeThr ? 0.2 : 0.0), 1.0) * 100.0
meanRevScore  = math.min((adxVal < adxRangeThr ? (adxRangeThr - adxVal) / 10.0 : 0.0) + (cChop > 61.8 ? (cChop - 61.8) / 20.0 : 0.0) + (bbwContracting ? 0.3 : 0.0), 1.0) * 100.0
momentumScore = math.min((adxVal > adxRangeThr and adxVal <= adxTrendThr ? 0.5 : 0.0) + (not bbwContracting and not bbwExpanding ? 0.3 : 0.0) + (math.abs(nz(roc20)) > 3.0 ? 0.2 : 0.0), 1.0) * 100.0
regimeTrend    = trendScore >= 60
regimeBreakout = breakoutScore >= 60
regimeMeanRev  = meanRevScore >= 60
regimeMomentum = momentumScore >= 55 and not regimeBreakout and not regimeTrend and not regimeMeanRev
regime = regimeBreakout ? 2 : regimeTrend ? 4 : regimeMomentum ? 3 : regimeMeanRev ? 1 : 0
regimeConf = regime == 1 ? meanRevScore : regime == 2 ? breakoutScore : regime == 3 ? momentumScore : regime == 4 ? trendScore : 0.0

// ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
// ║ SHARED RUBRIC (ASR v3 [F9]: trigger is a boolean gate worth zero)        ║
// ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
f_rubric(bool trig, float trend, float mom, float loc, float vol, float htf) =>
    trig ? math.min(100.0, math.max(0.0, trend) + math.max(0.0, mom) + math.max(0.0, loc) + math.max(0.0, vol) + math.max(0.0, htf)) : 0.0

aboveLT  = not na(sma200) and close > sma200
ltUp     = not na(sma50) and not na(sma200) and sma50 > sma200
volScore = (volAboveAvg ? 10.0 : 0.0) + (nz(rvPctile, 50.0) > 70.0 ? 5.0 : 0.0)
atrSane  = not na(atrPctile) and atrPctile >= 15.0 and atrPctile <= 85.0

// ── S1: RSI mean reversion ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
s1_rsi      = ta.rsi(close, s1_rsiLen)
s1_nearSupp = close - ta.lowest(low, s1_supportLen) < atr * 1.5
s1_trig     = s1_rsi < s1_oversold and s1_nearSupp
s1_trendC   = aboveLT and ltUp ? 25.0 : aboveLT ? 18.0 : not na(sma50) and close > sma50 ? 10.0 : 0.0
s1_score    = f_rubric(s1_trig, s1_trendC,
     (s1_rsi < s1_oversold - 10 ? 25.0 : s1_rsi < s1_oversold - 5 ? 20.0 : 14.0),
     (nz(distFromHi, 50.0) > 50.0 ? 12.0 : nz(distFromHi, 50.0) > 30.0 ? 7.0 : 3.0) + (atrSane ? 8.0 : 0.0),
     volScore,
     (regimeMeanRev ? 15.0 : regime == 0 ? 8.0 : 0.0))

// ── S3: EMA momentum (VWMA stands in for VWAP on daily bars) ───────────────
s3_fast  = ta.ema(close, s3_fastEMA)
s3_slow  = ta.ema(close, s3_slowEMA)
s3_trend = ta.ema(close, s3_trendEMA)
[s3_macd, s3_sig, s3_hist] = ta.macd(close, s3_macdFast, s3_macdSlow, s3_macdSig)
s3_anchor = ta.vwma(close, 20)
s3_bsUp  = ta.barssince(ta.crossover(s3_fast, s3_slow))
s3_trig  = not na(s3_bsUp) and s3_bsUp <= s3_crossMax and rsi14 <= 70
s3_score = f_rubric(s3_trig,
     (close > s3_trend ? 12.0 : 0.0) + (close > s3_anchor ? 8.0 : 0.0) + (aboveLT ? 5.0 : 0.0),
     (s3_hist > 0 and rsi14 > 50 ? 15.0 : s3_hist > 0 ? 8.0 : 0.0) + (nz(roc20) > 3.0 ? 6.0 : 0.0) + (s3_hist > nz(s3_hist[1]) ? 4.0 : 0.0),
     (s3_fast > s3_slow ? 8.0 : 0.0) + (close - s3_trend < atr * 3.0 ? 6.0 : 0.0) + (atrSane ? 6.0 : 0.0),
     volScore,
     (regimeMomentum ? 15.0 : regime == 4 ? 10.0 : regime == 2 ? 8.0 : regime == 0 ? 5.0 : 0.0))

// ── S4: multi-timeframe trend (weekly bull + daily pullback) ───────────────
s4_dEMA  = ta.ema(close, s4_dailyEMA)
[s4_macd, s4_sig, s4_h] = ta.macd(close, 12, 26, 9)
s4_pbBuy  = rsi14 < s4_rsiPBLo and rsi14 > 25
s4_bounce = close > s4_dEMA and close[1] <= s4_dEMA[1]
s4_trig   = wkBull and (s4_pbBuy or s4_bounce)
s4_score  = f_rubric(s4_trig,
     (wkBull ? 15.0 : 0.0) + (aboveLT ? 10.0 : 0.0),
     (nz(wkADX) > 20.0 ? 10.0 : 0.0) + (s4_macd > s4_sig ? 8.0 : 0.0) + (nz(mom121) > 0.0 ? 7.0 : 0.0),
     (s4_pbBuy ? 12.0 : s4_bounce ? 8.0 : 0.0) + (atrSane ? 8.0 : 0.0),
     volScore,
     (regimeTrend ? 15.0 : regime == 3 ? 10.0 : regime == 0 ? 5.0 : 0.0))

// ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
// ║ GROWTH LANE (UNVALIDATED — rank, forward-test, do not size on it)        ║
// ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
// Trend template (after Minervini): price > 50D > 150D > 200D, 200D rising for
// a month, >= 25% above the 52-week low, within 25% of the 52-week high,
// weekly 20 > 50 EMA. Momentum: 12-1 (Jegadeesh-Titman), RS vs benchmark.
// Fundamentals: revenue and diluted-EPS one-year growth (O'Neil C/A thresholds).
tt_stack  = not na(sma150) and close > sma50 and sma50 > sma150 and sma150 > sma200
tt_rising = not na(sma200[21]) and sma200 > sma200[21]
tt_offLow = nz(pctAboveLo) >= 25.0
tt_nearHi = nz(pctFromHi, -100.0) >= -25.0
tt_weekly = wkBull
gr_ttCount = (tt_stack ? 1 : 0) + (tt_rising ? 1 : 0) + (tt_offLow ? 1 : 0) + (tt_nearHi ? 1 : 0) + (tt_weekly ? 1 : 0)
gr_trendC = (tt_stack ? 10.0 : aboveLT ? 4.0 : 0.0) + (tt_rising ? 5.0 : 0.0) + (tt_offLow ? 5.0 : 0.0) + (tt_nearHi ? 5.0 : 0.0) + (tt_weekly ? 5.0 : 0.0)
gr_momC   = (nz(mom121) > 0.0 ? 8.0 : 0.0) + (nz(rs6m) > 0.0 ? 6.0 : 0.0) + (nz(rs3m) > 0.0 ? 6.0 : 0.0)
gr_revC   = na(revGrowth) ? 0.0 : revGrowth >= 25.0 ? 15.0 : revGrowth >= 15.0 ? 10.0 : revGrowth >= 8.0 ? 5.0 : 0.0
gr_epsC   = na(epsGrowth) ? 0.0 : epsGrowth >= 25.0 ? 15.0 : epsGrowth >= 15.0 ? 10.0 : epsGrowth >= 0.0 ? 5.0 : 0.0
gr_fundC  = gr_revC + gr_epsC

sma50Rising = not na(sma50[5]) and sma50 > sma50[5]
gr_pb50    = sma50Rising and low <= sma50 + atr * 0.5 and close > sma50 and close > sma200
gr_reclaim = ta.crossover(close, sma50) and close > sma200 and tt_rising
base100    = ta.highest(high, 100)
gr_baseBO  = close > base100[1] and volume > volSMA20 * 1.5 and close > sma200
gr_trigCode = gr_pb50 ? 5 : gr_reclaim ? 6 : gr_baseBO ? 7 : 0
gr_trig    = gr_trigCode > 0
gr_locC    = (gr_pb50 ? 12.0 : gr_reclaim ? 10.0 : gr_baseBO ? 10.0 : 0.0) + (rsi14 >= 40.0 and rsi14 <= 65.0 ? 4.0 : 0.0) + (atrSane ? 4.0 : 0.0)
gr_score   = f_rubric(gr_trig, gr_trendC, gr_momC, gr_locC, 0.0, gr_fundC)

// ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
// ║ LANE ELIGIBILITY, RISK GEOMETRY, DEPLOY                                  ║
// ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
s1_elig = s1_trig and s1_trendC >= sw_s1Gate
s3_elig = s3_trig and s3_score >= sw_s3Gate
s4_elig = s4_trig and s4_score >= sw_s4Gate
swStrat = s1_elig ? 1 : s4_elig ? 4 : s3_elig ? 3 : 0
swScore = swStrat == 1 ? s1_score : swStrat == 4 ? s4_score : swStrat == 3 ? s3_score : 0.0
swTrig  = swStrat > 0

// Swing geometry (ASR SWING profile, stopScale = 1)
swStopD  = swStrat == 1 ? atr * 1.2 : swStrat == 3 ? atr * 1.8 : atr * 2.5
swTpD    = swStrat == 1 ? math.min(math.max(math.abs(nz(bbMid, close) - close), atr * 1.5), atr * 4.0) : swStrat == 3 ? atr * 3.0 : atr * 4.0
entryRef = math.round_to_mintick(close)
swStopPx = math.round_to_mintick(close - swStopD)
swTpPx   = math.round_to_mintick(close + swTpD)
swRisk   = entryRef - swStopPx
swR      = swRisk > 0 ? (swTpPx - entryRef) / swRisk : 0.0
swRiskPct = close > 0 ? swRisk / close * 100.0 : na

// Positional geometry (ASR POSITIONAL profile: S4 x stopMult / 1.5)
po_elig  = s4_trig and s4_score >= po_s4Gate
poScale  = po_stopMult / 1.5
poStopPx = math.round_to_mintick(close - atr * 2.5 * poScale)
poTpPx   = math.round_to_mintick(close + atr * 4.0 * poScale)
poRisk   = entryRef - poStopPx
poR      = poRisk > 0 ? (poTpPx - entryRef) / poRisk : 0.0
poRiskPct = close > 0 ? poRisk / close * 100.0 : na
poStruct = (wkBull ? 1 : 0) + (ltUp ? 1 : 0) + (tt_rising ? 1 : 0) + (nz(mom121) > 0.0 ? 1 : 0) + (nz(rs6m) > 0.0 ? 1 : 0)

// Growth geometry: structural stop, no fixed target (exit = weekly close < 200D or weekly 20 < 50 EMA)
grStopPx  = math.round_to_mintick(math.min(sma50 - atr, ta.lowest(low, 10) - atr * 0.25))
grRisk    = entryRef - grStopPx
grRiskPct = close > 0 and grRisk > 0 ? grRisk / close * 100.0 : na
grRoomPct = hi52 > 0 ? (hi52 / close - 1.0) * 100.0 : na

// Common gates
liqOk   = (minAdvM <= 0.0 or (not na(advUsd) and advUsd >= minAdvM * 1000000.0)) and (minPrice <= 0.0 or close >= minPrice)
f_earnOk(int days) => days <= 0 or not earnAnyKnown or daysToEarn > days + (earnEstKnown ? earnEstCushion : 0)
f_mktOk(int minReg) => minReg <= 0 or na(mktRegime) or mktRegime >= minReg

// Cooldown: one signal per setup per lane (v1.0 had this; the screener edition
// needs it too, or the chart stacks a marker on every bar the condition persists).
var int swDepBar = na
var int poDepBar = na
var int grDepBar = na
swCoolOk = sw_cool <= 0 or na(swDepBar) or bar_index - swDepBar > sw_cool
poCoolOk = po_cool <= 0 or na(poDepBar) or bar_index - poDepBar > po_cool
grCoolOk = gr_cool <= 0 or na(grDepBar) or bar_index - grDepBar > gr_cool

swDeploy = warmOk and swTrig and liqOk and swR >= minRR and f_earnOk(sw_earnDays) and f_mktOk(sw_mktMin) and swCoolOk
poDeploy = warmOk and po_elig and liqOk and poR >= minRR and f_earnOk(po_earnDays) and f_mktOk(po_mktMin) and poCoolOk
grDeploy = warmOk and gr_trig and gr_score >= gr_gate and liqOk and (not gr_requireFund or fundOk) and (not gr_requireAccel or accelOk) and not na(grRiskPct) and grRiskPct <= gr_maxRisk and f_earnOk(gr_earnDays) and f_mktOk(gr_mktMin) and grCoolOk

// ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
// ║ LANE STATE — last trigger per lane (frozen while the bar is forming)     ║
// ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
var int   swLastStrat = 0
var int   swLastBar   = na
var float swLastScore = na
var float swLastStop  = na
var float swLastTp    = na
var int   poLastBar   = na
var float poLastScore = na
var float poLastStop  = na
var int   grLastCode  = 0
var int   grLastBar   = na
var float grLastScore = na
var float grLastStop  = na

swEv = updateOk and swTrig and warmOk
poEv = updateOk and po_elig and warmOk
grEv = updateOk and gr_trig and warmOk
swLastStrat := swEv ? swStrat : swLastStrat
swLastBar   := swEv ? bar_index : swLastBar
swLastScore := swEv ? swScore : swLastScore
swLastStop  := swEv ? swStopPx : swLastStop
swLastTp    := swEv ? swTpPx : swLastTp
poLastBar   := poEv ? bar_index : poLastBar
poLastScore := poEv ? s4_score : poLastScore
poLastStop  := poEv ? poStopPx : poLastStop
grLastCode  := grEv ? gr_trigCode : grLastCode
grLastBar   := grEv ? bar_index : grLastBar
grLastScore := grEv ? gr_score : grLastScore
grLastStop  := grEv ? grStopPx : grLastStop

swDepBar := updateOk and swDeploy ? bar_index : swDepBar
poDepBar := updateOk and poDeploy ? bar_index : poDepBar
grDepBar := updateOk and grDeploy ? bar_index : grDepBar

lastClosedBar = bar_index - off
float swBarsSince = na(swLastBar) ? na : lastClosedBar - swLastBar
float poBarsSince = na(poLastBar) ? na : lastClosedBar - poLastBar
float grBarsSince = na(grLastBar) ? na : lastClosedBar - grLastBar
float swBarsDep   = na(swDepBar) ? na : lastClosedBar - swDepBar
float poBarsDep   = na(poDepBar) ? na : lastClosedBar - poDepBar
float grBarsDep   = na(grDepBar) ? na : lastClosedBar - grDepBar
swCoolRem = na(swDepBar) ? 0 : math.max(0, sw_cool - (lastClosedBar - swDepBar))
poCoolRem = na(poDepBar) ? 0 : math.max(0, po_cool - (lastClosedBar - poDepBar))
grCoolRem = na(grDepBar) ? 0 : math.max(0, gr_cool - (lastClosedBar - grDepBar))

// ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
// ║ OUTPUT RESOLUTION — closed-bar offset applied once, at global scope      ║
// ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
// Every value the columns, filters and dashboard use is resolved HERE, on every
// bar, so the history each o()/ob() call needs exists. Nothing below calls
// o()/ob() inside a conditional block.
swD        = ob(swDeploy)
poD        = ob(poDeploy)
grD        = ob(grDeploy)
warmO      = ob(warmOk)
benchO     = ob(benchOk)
fundO      = ob(fundOk)
earnKnownO = ob(earnKnown)
earnEstO   = ob(earnEstKnown)
accelOkO   = ob(accelOk)
secOkO     = ob(secOk)
breadthO   = ob(breadthOk)
liqO       = ob(liqOk)
swTrigO    = ob(swTrig)
poEligO    = ob(po_elig)
grTrigO    = ob(gr_trig)
s1TrigO    = ob(s1_trig)
s3TrigO    = ob(s3_trig)
s4TrigO    = ob(s4_trig)
s1EligO    = ob(s1_elig)
s3EligO    = ob(s3_elig)
s4EligO    = ob(s4_elig)
swEarnO    = ob(f_earnOk(sw_earnDays))
poEarnO    = ob(f_earnOk(po_earnDays))
grEarnO    = ob(f_earnOk(gr_earnDays))
swMktO     = ob(f_mktOk(sw_mktMin))
poMktO     = ob(f_mktOk(po_mktMin))
grMktO     = ob(f_mktOk(gr_mktMin))
swCoolO    = ob(swCoolOk)
poCoolO    = ob(poCoolOk)
grCoolO    = ob(grCoolOk)

swScoreO   = o(swScore)
swStratO   = o(swStrat)
swStopO    = o(swStopPx)
swTpO      = o(swTpPx)
swRO       = o(swR)
swRiskO    = o(swRiskPct)
s1ScoreO   = o(s1_score)
s3ScoreO   = o(s3_score)
s4ScoreO   = o(s4_score)
s1TrendO   = o(s1_trendC)
poStructO  = o(poStruct)
poStopO    = o(poStopPx)
poTpO      = o(poTpPx)
poRO       = o(poR)
poRiskO    = o(poRiskPct)
grScoreO   = o(gr_score)
grCodeO    = o(gr_trigCode)
grStopO    = o(grStopPx)
grRiskO    = o(grRiskPct)
grTtO      = o(gr_ttCount)
grRoomO    = o(grRoomPct)
entryO     = o(entryRef)
dteO       = o(daysToEarn)
dteExactO  = o(daysToEarnExact)
dteEstO    = o(daysToEarnEst)
mktO       = o(mktRegime)
rs3mO      = o(rs3m)
rs6mO      = o(rs6m)
rsSecO     = o(rsSec3m)
secTrendO  = o(secTrend)
s5fiO      = o(s5fi)
s5thO      = o(s5th)
epsG0O     = o(epsG0)
revG0O     = o(revG0)
epsAccelO  = o(epsAccel)
revAccelO  = o(revAccel)
epsBigQO   = o(epsBigQ)
advO       = o(advUsd)
revO       = o(revGrowth)
epsO       = o(epsGrowth)
mom121O    = o(mom121)
pctFromHiO = o(pctFromHi)
distLoO    = o(distFromLo)
roc20O     = o(roc20)
roc60O     = o(roc60)
atrPctO    = o(atrPctile)
rvPctO     = o(rvPctile)
rsiO       = o(rsi14)
adxO       = o(adxVal)
chopO      = o(cChop)
regimeO    = o(regime)
regConfO   = o(regimeConf)

horizon   = grD ? 3 : (poD and poStructO >= po_minStruct) ? 2 : swD ? 1 : 0
lanesBits = (swD ? 1 : 0) + (poD ? 2 : 0) + (grD ? 4 : 0)
adsScore  = horizon == 3 ? grScoreO : horizon == 2 ? s4ScoreO : horizon == 1 ? swScoreO : 0.0
stratCode = horizon == 3 ? grCodeO : horizon == 2 ? 4.0 : horizon == 1 ? swStratO : 0.0
stopPx    = horizon == 3 ? grStopO : horizon == 2 ? poStopO : horizon == 1 ? swStopO : na
tpPx      = horizon == 2 ? poTpO : horizon == 1 ? swTpO : na
riskPct   = horizon == 3 ? grRiskO : horizon == 2 ? poRiskO : horizon == 1 ? swRiskO : na
rMult     = horizon == 2 ? poRO : horizon == 1 ? swRO : na
anyTrigToday = (swTrigO or poEligO or grTrigO) and warmO
dataBits  = (warmO ? 1 : 0) + (benchO ? 2 : 0) + (fundO ? 4 : 0) + (earnKnownO ? 8 : 0) + (isDailyTF ? 16 : 0) + (earnEstO ? 32 : 0) + (secOkO ? 64 : 0) + (breadthO ? 128 : 0)

// Block reasons: the one gate responsible, named (never a bare "no trigger"
// when a strategy did trigger and lost to its score gate).
f_n(float v) => str.tostring(v, "#")
earnTxt = earnKnownO ? "EARNINGS " + f_n(dteO) + "d" : earnEstO ? "EARNINGS ~" + f_n(dteO) + "d est" : "EARNINGS"
swTrigWhy = s4TrigO ? "S4 " + f_n(s4ScoreO) + "<" + f_n(sw_s4Gate) : s3TrigO ? "S3 " + f_n(s3ScoreO) + "<" + f_n(sw_s3Gate) : s1TrigO ? "S1 trend " + f_n(s1TrendO) + "<" + f_n(sw_s1Gate) : "no trigger"
blockSw = not warmO ? "WARMUP" : not swTrigO ? swTrigWhy : not liqO ? "LIQUIDITY" : swRO < minRR ? "R:R " + str.tostring(swRO, "0.0") : not swEarnO ? earnTxt : not swMktO ? "MKT REGIME" : not swCoolO ? "COOLDOWN " + f_n(swCoolRem) : "DEPLOY"
blockPo = not warmO ? "WARMUP" : not poEligO ? (s4TrigO ? "S4 " + f_n(s4ScoreO) + "<" + f_n(po_s4Gate) : "no trigger") : not liqO ? "LIQUIDITY" : poRO < minRR ? "R:R " + str.tostring(poRO, "0.0") : not poEarnO ? earnTxt : not poMktO ? "MKT REGIME" : not poCoolO ? "COOLDOWN " + f_n(poCoolRem) : "DEPLOY"
blockGr = not warmO ? "WARMUP" : not grTrigO ? "no trigger" : grScoreO < gr_gate ? "score " + f_n(grScoreO) + "<" + f_n(gr_gate) : not liqO ? "LIQUIDITY" : (gr_requireFund and not fundO) ? "NO FUND DATA" : (gr_requireAccel and not accelOkO) ? "NO EPS ACCEL" : (na(grRiskO) or grRiskO > gr_maxRisk) ? "RISK " + str.tostring(grRiskO, "0.#") + "%>" + f_n(gr_maxRisk) : not grEarnO ? earnTxt : not grMktO ? "MKT REGIME" : not grCoolO ? "COOLDOWN " + f_n(grCoolRem) : "DEPLOY"

// ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
// ║ SCREENER COLUMNS — the first 10 are the default view, in decision order  ║
// ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
// Columns live in the Data Window only: not on the pane, not on the price scale,
// and not in the status line, which would otherwise print 44 numbers across the chart.
colDisp = display.data_window
plot(adsScore,          "ADS Score",                                           display = colDisp)
plot(horizon,           "Horizon (1 SW 2 POS 3 GR)",                           display = colDisp)
plot(stratCode,         "Strategy (1 MR 3 MOM 4 MTF 5 PB50 6 RECLAIM 7 BASE)", display = colDisp)
plot(lanesBits,         "Lanes Deploy (bits 1 SW 2 POS 4 GR)",                 display = colDisp)
plot(riskPct,           "Risk %",                                              display = colDisp)
plot(rMult,             "R Multiple",                                          display = colDisp)
plot(dteO,              "Days to Earnings (exact, else cadence est)",          display = colDisp)
plot(mktO,              "Mkt Regime (0 below 200D, 1 above, 2 above + rising 50D)", display = colDisp)
plot(rs3mO,             "RS 3M %",                                             display = colDisp)
plot(advO / 1000000.0,  "ADV $M (20d)",                                        display = colDisp)
// ── lane detail ──
plot(swScoreO,          "SW Score",                                            display = colDisp)
plot(swStratO,          "SW Strategy (1 MR 3 MOM 4 MTF)",                      display = colDisp)
plot(swBarsDep,         "SW Bars Since Deploy",                                display = colDisp)
plot(swBarsSince,       "SW Bars Since Trigger",                               display = colDisp)
plot(swLastStrat,       "SW Last Trigger",                                     display = colDisp)
plot(swLastScore,       "SW Last Score",                                       display = colDisp)
plot(s4ScoreO,          "POS Score (S4)",                                      display = colDisp)
plot(poStructO,         "POS Structure (0-5)",                                 display = colDisp)
plot(poBarsDep,         "POS Bars Since Deploy",                               display = colDisp)
plot(poBarsSince,       "POS Bars Since Trigger",                              display = colDisp)
plot(poLastScore,       "POS Last Score",                                      display = colDisp)
plot(grScoreO,          "GR Score (unvalidated)",                              display = colDisp)
plot(grCodeO,           "GR Trigger (5 PB50 6 RECLAIM 7 BASE)",                display = colDisp)
plot(grBarsDep,         "GR Bars Since Deploy",                                display = colDisp)
plot(grBarsSince,       "GR Bars Since Trigger",                               display = colDisp)
plot(grLastScore,       "GR Last Score",                                       display = colDisp)
plot(grTtO,             "GR Trend Template (0-5)",                             display = colDisp)
plot(revO,              "Rev Growth %",                                        display = colDisp)
plot(epsO,              "EPS Growth %",                                        display = colDisp)
plot(grRoomO,           "GR Room to 52W High %",                               display = colDisp)
// ── geometry & context ──
plot(entryO,            "Entry Ref",                                           display = colDisp)
plot(stopPx,            "Stop Price",                                          display = colDisp)
plot(tpPx,              "Target Price",                                        display = colDisp)
plot(rs6mO,             "RS 6M %",                                             display = colDisp)
plot(mom121O,           "12-1 Momentum %",                                     display = colDisp)
plot(pctFromHiO,        "Pct from 52W High",                                   display = colDisp)
plot(atrPctO,           "ATR Pctile (252d)",                                   display = colDisp)
plot(rvPctO,            "RelVol Pctile (50d)",                                 display = colDisp)
plot(rsiO,              "RSI 14",                                              display = colDisp)
plot(regimeO,           "Regime (0 N 1 MR 2 BO 3 MOM 4 TR)",                   display = colDisp)
// ── v2.2: earnings estimate, sector, breadth, quarterly acceleration ──
plot(dteEstO,           "Days to Earnings Est (cadence)",                      display = colDisp)
plot(secCode,           "Sector ETF (1 XLK 2 XLF 3 XLV 4 XLP 5 XLY 6 XLI 7 XLE 8 XLB 9 XLU 10 XLC)", display = colDisp)
plot(rsSecO,            "Sector RS 3M %",                                      display = colDisp)
plot(secTrendO,         "Sector Trend (0 below 200D, 1 above, 2 above + rising 50D)", display = colDisp)
plot(s5fiO,             "Breadth Pct Above 50D (S5FI)",                        display = colDisp)
plot(s5thO,             "Breadth Pct Above 200D (S5TH)",                       display = colDisp)
plot(epsG0O,            "EPS YoY Latest Q %",                                  display = colDisp)
plot(epsAccelO,         "EPS Accel (0-2 rising quarters)",                     display = colDisp)
plot(epsBigQO,          "EPS Quarters 25pct Plus (0-3)",                       display = colDisp)
plot(revG0O,            "Rev YoY Latest Q %",                                  display = colDisp)
plot(revAccelO,         "Rev Accel (0-2 rising quarters)",                     display = colDisp)
plot(dataBits,          "Data OK (bits 1 warm 2 bench 4 fund 8 earn 16 1D 32 earn est 64 sector 128 breadth)", display = colDisp)

// ── boolean filters ──
alertcondition(swD, "ADS2 Swing deploy", "ADS2 swing deploy on {{ticker}}")
alertcondition(poD, "ADS2 Positional deploy", "ADS2 positional deploy on {{ticker}}")
alertcondition(grD, "ADS2 Growth deploy", "ADS2 growth deploy on {{ticker}}")
alertcondition(horizon > 0, "ADS2 Any deploy", "ADS2 deploy on {{ticker}}")
alertcondition(anyTrigToday, "ADS2 Any trigger (closed bar)", "ADS2 trigger on {{ticker}}")

// ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
// ║ CHART — reference levels for the last deploy (Entry / SL / TP, v1.0 style)║
// ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
// The last fresh deploy sets the reference: entry at that close, the lane's
// stop and target. Lines persist until the stop or the target is touched
// (growth: until close drops below the 200D), then clear. Reference only.
swLabel  = swStratO == 1 ? "MR" : swStratO == 4 ? "MTF" : swStratO == 3 ? "MOM" : "--"
grLabel  = grCodeO == 5 ? "PB50" : grCodeO == 6 ? "RECLAIM" : grCodeO == 7 ? "BASE" : "--"
regLabel = regimeO == 4 ? "TRENDING" : regimeO == 2 ? "BREAKOUT" : regimeO == 3 ? "MOMENTUM" : regimeO == 1 ? "MEAN_REV" : "NEUTRAL"
horLabel = horizon == 3 ? "GROWTH" : horizon == 2 ? "POSITIONAL" : horizon == 1 ? "SWING" : "none"
stratLbl = horizon == 3 ? grLabel : horizon == 2 ? "MTF" : horizon == 1 ? swLabel : "--"
f_laneName(int ln) => ln == 3 ? "GROWTH" : ln == 2 ? "POSITIONAL" : ln == 1 ? "SWING" : "--"

var int   refLane  = 0
var float refEntry = na
var float refSL    = na
var float refTP    = na
var int   refBar   = na
var string refTag  = ""
var line  lnEntry  = na
var line  lnSL     = na
var line  lnTP     = na
var label lbEntry  = na
var label lbSL     = na
var label lbTP     = na

refHitSL   = refLane > 0 and bar_index > refBar and not na(refSL) and low <= refSL
refHitTP   = refLane > 0 and bar_index > refBar and not na(refTP) and high >= refTP
refHitExit = refLane == 3 and bar_index > refBar and not na(sma200) and close < sma200
refClosed  = updateOk and (refHitSL or refHitTP or refHitExit)
newRef     = updateOk and horizon > 0

if refClosed or newRef
    if not na(lnEntry)
        line.delete(lnEntry)
    if not na(lnSL)
        line.delete(lnSL)
    if not na(lnTP)
        line.delete(lnTP)
    if not na(lbEntry)
        label.delete(lbEntry)
    if not na(lbSL)
        label.delete(lbSL)
    if not na(lbTP)
        label.delete(lbTP)
    refLane := 0
    refEntry := na
    refSL := na
    refTP := na
    refBar := na
    refTag := ""

if newRef
    refLane  := horizon
    refEntry := entryO
    refSL    := stopPx
    refTP    := tpPx
    refBar   := bar_index
    refTag   := horLabel + " " + stratLbl
    if showLevels
        lnEntry := line.new(bar_index, refEntry, bar_index + levelBars, refEntry, color = color.new(color.white, 10), width = 1, style = line.style_dotted)
        lnSL    := line.new(bar_index, refSL, bar_index + levelBars, refSL, color = color.red, width = 2, style = line.style_solid)
        lbEntry := label.new(bar_index + levelBars + 1, refEntry, refTag + " · Entry " + str.tostring(refEntry, "0.##") + " · score " + f_n(adsScore), color = color.new(color.white, 80), textcolor = color.white, style = label.style_label_left, size = size.tiny)
        lbSL    := label.new(bar_index + levelBars + 1, refSL, "SL " + str.tostring(refSL, "0.##") + " (" + str.tostring(riskPct, "0.#") + "%)", color = color.new(color.red, 80), textcolor = color.red, style = label.style_label_left, size = size.tiny)
        if not na(refTP)
            lnTP := line.new(bar_index, refTP, bar_index + levelBars, refTP, color = color.green, width = 2, style = line.style_solid)
            lbTP := label.new(bar_index + levelBars + 1, refTP, "TP " + str.tostring(refTP, "0.##") + " (R:R " + str.tostring(rMult, "0.0") + ")", color = color.new(color.green, 80), textcolor = color.green, style = label.style_label_left, size = size.tiny)
        else
            lbTP := label.new(bar_index + levelBars + 1, refEntry + (refEntry - refSL), "no TP · exit close<200D · room " + str.tostring(grRoomO, "0.#") + "% to 52W hi", color = color.new(color.purple, 80), textcolor = color.new(color.purple, 0), style = label.style_label_left, size = size.tiny)

refPnlPct = refLane > 0 and not na(refEntry) and refEntry > 0 ? (close - refEntry) / refEntry * 100.0 : na

// ── Preview while today's bar is still forming (dashed, v1.0 style) ────────
var line  pvEnt  = na
var line  pvSL   = na
var line  pvTP   = na
var label pvEntL = na
var label pvSLL  = na
var label pvTPL  = na
if not na(pvEnt)
    line.delete(pvEnt)
if not na(pvSL)
    line.delete(pvSL)
if not na(pvTP)
    line.delete(pvTP)
if not na(pvEntL)
    label.delete(pvEntL)
if not na(pvSLL)
    label.delete(pvSLL)
if not na(pvTPL)
    label.delete(pvTPL)

rawHorizon = grDeploy ? 3 : (poDeploy and poStruct >= po_minStruct) ? 2 : swDeploy ? 1 : 0
previewOk  = showPreview and useClosedOnly and forming and rawHorizon > 0
if previewOk
    pvStop = rawHorizon == 3 ? grStopPx : rawHorizon == 2 ? poStopPx : swStopPx
    pvTp   = rawHorizon == 2 ? poTpPx : rawHorizon == 1 ? swTpPx : na
    pvRisk = close > 0 ? (entryRef - pvStop) / close * 100.0 : na
    pvEnt  := line.new(bar_index, entryRef, bar_index + 15, entryRef, color = color.new(color.white, 50), width = 1, style = line.style_dashed)
    pvSL   := line.new(bar_index, pvStop, bar_index + 15, pvStop, color = color.new(color.red, 50), width = 1, style = line.style_dashed)
    pvEntL := label.new(bar_index + 16, entryRef, "~ " + f_laneName(rawHorizon) + " Entry " + str.tostring(entryRef, "0.##") + " (bar not closed)", color = color.new(color.white, 90), textcolor = color.new(color.white, 30), style = label.style_label_left, size = size.tiny)
    pvSLL  := label.new(bar_index + 16, pvStop, "~ SL " + str.tostring(pvStop, "0.##") + " (" + str.tostring(pvRisk, "0.#") + "%)", color = color.new(color.red, 90), textcolor = color.new(color.red, 30), style = label.style_label_left, size = size.tiny)
    if not na(pvTp)
        pvTP  := line.new(bar_index, pvTp, bar_index + 15, pvTp, color = color.new(color.green, 50), width = 1, style = line.style_dashed)
        pvTPL := label.new(bar_index + 16, pvTp, "~ TP " + str.tostring(pvTp, "0.##"), color = color.new(color.green, 90), textcolor = color.new(color.green, 30), style = label.style_label_left, size = size.tiny)

// ── Earnings-blocked candidate (chart only; the Screener cannot see the date) ─
// A lane that passed every gate EXCEPT the earnings blackout is exactly what the
// Screener reports as a deploy. Draw its levels in grey on the last closed bar
// with the reason, so a Screener row never looks like a missing drawing.
swBlkE  = warmO and swTrigO and liqO and swRO >= minRR and not swEarnO and swMktO and swCoolO
poBlkE  = warmO and poEligO and liqO and poRO >= minRR and not poEarnO and poMktO and poCoolO
grBlkE  = warmO and grTrigO and grScoreO >= gr_gate and liqO and (not gr_requireFund or fundO) and (not gr_requireAccel or accelOkO) and not na(grRiskO) and grRiskO <= gr_maxRisk and not grEarnO and grMktO and grCoolO
blkLane = horizon > 0 ? 0 : grBlkE ? 3 : (poBlkE and poStructO >= po_minStruct) ? 2 : swBlkE ? 1 : 0
blkStop = blkLane == 3 ? grStopO : blkLane == 2 ? poStopO : blkLane == 1 ? swStopO : na
blkTp   = blkLane == 2 ? poTpO : blkLane == 1 ? swTpO : na
blkRisk = blkLane == 3 ? grRiskO : blkLane == 2 ? poRiskO : blkLane == 1 ? swRiskO : na
blkR    = blkLane == 2 ? poRO : blkLane == 1 ? swRO : na
blkScr  = blkLane == 3 ? grScoreO : blkLane == 2 ? s4ScoreO : blkLane == 1 ? swScoreO : 0.0
blkTag  = f_laneName(blkLane) + " " + (blkLane == 3 ? grLabel : blkLane == 2 ? "MTF" : blkLane == 1 ? swLabel : "--")
blkWhy  = earnTxt

var line  bkEnt  = na
var line  bkSL   = na
var line  bkTP   = na
var label bkEntL = na
var label bkSLL  = na
var label bkTPL  = na
if not na(bkEnt)
    line.delete(bkEnt)
if not na(bkSL)
    line.delete(bkSL)
if not na(bkTP)
    line.delete(bkTP)
if not na(bkEntL)
    label.delete(bkEntL)
if not na(bkSLL)
    label.delete(bkSLL)
if not na(bkTPL)
    label.delete(bkTPL)

blockedOk = showBlocked and barstate.islast and blkLane > 0
if blockedOk
    bx0  = bar_index - off
    gyLn = color.new(color.gray, 15)
    gyBg = color.new(color.gray, 70)
    gyTx = color.new(color.white, 15)
    bkEnt  := line.new(bx0, entryO, bx0 + levelBars, entryO, color = gyLn, width = 1, style = line.style_dashed)
    bkSL   := line.new(bx0, blkStop, bx0 + levelBars, blkStop, color = gyLn, width = 1, style = line.style_dashed)
    bkEntL := label.new(bx0 + levelBars + 1, entryO, blkTag + " · Entry " + str.tostring(entryO, "0.##") + " · score " + f_n(blkScr) + " · NO DEPLOY: " + blkWhy, color = gyBg, textcolor = gyTx, style = label.style_label_left, size = size.tiny)
    bkSLL  := label.new(bx0 + levelBars + 1, blkStop, "SL " + str.tostring(blkStop, "0.##") + " (" + str.tostring(blkRisk, "0.#") + "%)", color = gyBg, textcolor = gyTx, style = label.style_label_left, size = size.tiny)
    if not na(blkTp)
        bkTP  := line.new(bx0, blkTp, bx0 + levelBars, blkTp, color = gyLn, width = 1, style = line.style_dashed)
        bkTPL := label.new(bx0 + levelBars + 1, blkTp, "TP " + str.tostring(blkTp, "0.##") + " (R:R " + str.tostring(blkR, "0.0") + ")", color = gyBg, textcolor = gyTx, style = label.style_label_left, size = size.tiny)
    else
        bkTPL := label.new(bx0 + levelBars + 1, entryO + (entryO - blkStop), "no TP · exit close<200D · room " + str.tostring(grRoomO, "0.#") + "% to 52W hi", color = gyBg, textcolor = gyTx, style = label.style_label_left, size = size.tiny)

// ── Lines and markers ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
plot(showLines ? sma50 : na,  "SMA 50",  color = color.new(color.blue, 40),   display = display.pane)
plot(showLines ? sma150 : na, "SMA 150", color = color.new(color.orange, 55), display = display.pane)
plot(showLines ? sma200 : na, "SMA 200", color = color.new(color.gray, 30),   display = display.pane)

// One marker per bar, the Horizon lane only; never on the forming bar in closed-bar mode.
mk = showShapes and horizon > 0 and not (useClosedOnly and forming)
// Pine counts plot(), plotshape() and alertcondition() against one 64-output
// limit: 52 columns + 3 SMAs + 3 markers + 5 filters = 63. The S/P/G letter
// variant of the markers was dropped in v2.2 to stay under it.
plotshape(mk and horizon == 1, "Swing deploy", shape.triangleup, location.belowbar, color.green, size = size.small, display = display.pane)
plotshape(mk and horizon == 2, "Positional deploy", shape.triangleup, location.belowbar, color.teal, size = size.small, display = display.pane)
plotshape(mk and horizon == 3, "Growth deploy", shape.triangleup, location.belowbar, color.purple, size = size.small, display = display.pane)

// ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
// ║ DASHBOARD (v1.0 layout: strategy rows → winner → risk → position → context)║
// ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
var table tbl = table.new(dashPos, 4, 18, border_color = color.gray, border_width = 1, frame_color = color.gray, frame_width = 2)
if barstate.islast and showDash
    okC = color.green
    noC = color.gray
    wC  = color.white
    hdrBg = color.navy
    // header
    table.cell(tbl, 0, 0, syminfo.ticker, bgcolor = color.black, text_color = wC, text_size = size.normal)
    table.cell(tbl, 1, 0, timeframe.period + (off == 1 ? " prev" : ""), bgcolor = hdrBg, text_color = wC, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(tbl, 2, 0, "Score", bgcolor = color.black, text_color = wC, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(tbl, 3, 0, "Status", bgcolor = color.black, text_color = wC, text_size = size.small)
    // regime (metadata)
    rgC = regimeO == 4 ? color.green : regimeO == 2 ? color.yellow : regimeO == 3 ? color.blue : regimeO == 1 ? color.purple : color.gray
    table.cell(tbl, 0, 1, "REGIME", bgcolor = color.maroon, text_color = wC, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(tbl, 1, 1, regLabel, text_color = rgC, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(tbl, 2, 1, f_n(regConfO), text_color = rgC, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(tbl, 3, 1, "ADX=" + f_n(adxO) + " CH=" + f_n(chopO) + " · metadata", text_color = wC, text_size = size.tiny)
    // strategy rows
    table.cell(tbl, 0, 2, "S1 MeanRev", bgcolor = color.new(color.purple, 50), text_color = wC, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(tbl, 1, 2, s1TrigO ? "TRIG" : "—", text_color = s1TrigO ? okC : noC, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(tbl, 2, 2, f_n(s1ScoreO), text_color = s1EligO ? okC : noC, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(tbl, 3, 2, s1EligO ? "ELIGIBLE" : s1TrigO ? "trend " + f_n(s1TrendO) + "<" + f_n(sw_s1Gate) : "—", text_color = s1EligO ? okC : noC, text_size = size.tiny)
    table.cell(tbl, 0, 3, "S3 Momentum", bgcolor = color.new(color.blue, 50), text_color = wC, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(tbl, 1, 3, s3TrigO ? "TRIG" : "—", text_color = s3TrigO ? okC : noC, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(tbl, 2, 3, f_n(s3ScoreO) + "/" + f_n(sw_s3Gate), text_color = s3EligO ? okC : noC, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(tbl, 3, 3, s3EligO ? "ELIGIBLE" : s3TrigO ? "score<gate" : "—", text_color = s3EligO ? okC : noC, text_size = size.tiny)
    table.cell(tbl, 0, 4, "S4 MTF Trend", bgcolor = color.new(color.teal, 50), text_color = wC, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(tbl, 1, 4, s4TrigO ? "TRIG" : "—", text_color = s4TrigO ? okC : noC, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(tbl, 2, 4, f_n(s4ScoreO) + "/" + f_n(sw_s4Gate), text_color = s4EligO ? okC : noC, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(tbl, 3, 4, s4EligO ? "ELIGIBLE" : s4TrigO ? "score<gate" : "—", text_color = s4EligO ? okC : noC, text_size = size.tiny)
    table.cell(tbl, 0, 5, "GROWTH " + grLabel, bgcolor = color.new(color.purple, 65), text_color = wC, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(tbl, 1, 5, grTrigO ? "TRIG" : "—", text_color = grTrigO ? okC : noC, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(tbl, 2, 5, f_n(grScoreO) + "/" + f_n(gr_gate) + " tt " + f_n(grTtO) + "/5", text_color = grTrigO and grScoreO >= gr_gate ? okC : noC, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(tbl, 3, 5, grTrigO ? (grScoreO >= gr_gate ? "ELIGIBLE" : "score<gate") : "—", text_color = grTrigO and grScoreO >= gr_gate ? okC : noC, text_size = size.tiny)
    // lanes
    table.cell(tbl, 0, 6, "SWING", bgcolor = color.new(color.green, 70), text_color = wC, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(tbl, 1, 6, swTrigO ? swLabel + " BUY" : "—", text_color = swD ? okC : swTrigO ? color.yellow : noC, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(tbl, 2, 6, f_n(swScoreO), text_color = swD ? okC : noC, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(tbl, 3, 6, blockSw, text_color = blockSw == "DEPLOY" ? okC : swTrigO ? color.orange : noC, text_size = size.tiny)
    table.cell(tbl, 0, 7, "POSITIONAL", bgcolor = color.new(color.teal, 60), text_color = wC, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(tbl, 1, 7, poEligO ? "MTF BUY · str " + f_n(poStructO) + "/5" : "str " + f_n(poStructO) + "/5", text_color = poD ? okC : poEligO ? color.yellow : noC, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(tbl, 2, 7, poEligO ? f_n(s4ScoreO) : "0", text_color = poD ? okC : noC, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(tbl, 3, 7, blockPo, text_color = blockPo == "DEPLOY" ? okC : poEligO ? color.orange : noC, text_size = size.tiny)
    table.cell(tbl, 0, 8, "GROWTH", bgcolor = color.new(color.purple, 50), text_color = wC, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(tbl, 1, 8, grTrigO ? grLabel + " BUY" : "—", text_color = grD ? okC : grTrigO ? color.yellow : noC, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(tbl, 2, 8, f_n(grScoreO), text_color = grD ? okC : noC, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(tbl, 3, 8, blockGr, text_color = blockGr == "DEPLOY" ? okC : grTrigO ? color.orange : noC, text_size = size.tiny)
    // winner
    table.cell(tbl, 0, 9, "WINNER", bgcolor = hdrBg, text_color = wC, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(tbl, 1, 9, horizon > 0 ? horLabel + " " + stratLbl + " BUY" : blkLane > 0 ? blkTag + " (screener row)" : "—", text_color = horizon > 0 ? okC : blkLane > 0 ? color.orange : noC, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(tbl, 2, 9, horizon > 0 ? f_n(adsScore) : blkLane > 0 ? f_n(blkScr) : "0", text_color = horizon > 0 ? okC : blkLane > 0 ? color.orange : color.red, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(tbl, 3, 9, horizon > 0 ? "DEPLOY" : blkLane > 0 ? "WAIT · " + blkWhy : "WAIT", text_color = horizon > 0 ? okC : blkLane > 0 ? color.orange : noC, text_size = size.small)
    // risk for the winner (or the best triggered lane when nothing deploys)
    rkLane = horizon > 0 ? horizon : grTrigO ? 3 : poEligO ? 2 : swTrigO ? 1 : 0
    rkStop = rkLane == 3 ? grStopO : rkLane == 2 ? poStopO : rkLane == 1 ? swStopO : na
    rkTp   = rkLane == 2 ? poTpO : rkLane == 1 ? swTpO : na
    rkRisk = rkLane == 3 ? grRiskO : rkLane == 2 ? poRiskO : rkLane == 1 ? swRiskO : na
    rkR    = rkLane == 2 ? poRO : rkLane == 1 ? swRO : na
    table.cell(tbl, 0, 10, "Risk " + (rkLane > 0 ? f_laneName(rkLane) : ""), bgcolor = hdrBg, text_color = wC, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(tbl, 1, 10, rkLane > 0 ? "SL $" + str.tostring(rkStop, "0.##") + " (" + str.tostring(rkRisk, "0.#") + "%)" : "—", text_color = color.orange, text_size = size.tiny)
    table.cell(tbl, 2, 10, rkLane == 3 ? "exit: close<200D" : rkLane > 0 ? "TP $" + str.tostring(rkTp, "0.##") : "—", text_color = okC, text_size = size.tiny)
    table.cell(tbl, 3, 10, rkLane == 3 ? "room " + str.tostring(grRoomO, "0.#") + "% to 52W hi" : rkLane > 0 ? "R:R " + str.tostring(rkR, "0.0") : "—", text_color = rkLane == 3 ? wC : rkR >= 2.0 ? okC : rkR >= minRR ? color.yellow : color.red, text_size = size.tiny)
    // reference position
    table.cell(tbl, 0, 11, "Position (ref)", bgcolor = hdrBg, text_color = wC, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(tbl, 1, 11, refLane > 0 ? "LONG @ " + str.tostring(refEntry, "0.##") + " · " + refTag : "FLAT", text_color = refLane > 0 ? okC : noC, text_size = size.tiny)
    table.cell(tbl, 2, 11, refLane > 0 ? (refPnlPct >= 0 ? "+" : "") + str.tostring(refPnlPct, "0.##") + "%" : "", text_color = refPnlPct >= 0 ? okC : color.red, text_size = size.tiny)
    table.cell(tbl, 3, 11, refLane > 0 ? "SL " + str.tostring(refSL, "0.##") + (na(refTP) ? " · exit<200D" : " · TP " + str.tostring(refTP, "0.##")) + " · " + str.tostring(bar_index - refBar) + "b" : "", text_color = wC, text_size = size.tiny)
    // context
    table.cell(tbl, 0, 12, "RSI", bgcolor = hdrBg, text_color = wC, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(tbl, 1, 12, str.tostring(rsiO, "0.#"), text_color = rsiO < 30 ? okC : rsiO > 70 ? color.red : wC, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(tbl, 2, 12, "rVol=" + f_n(rvPctO) + "p", text_color = rvPctO > 70 ? okC : noC, text_size = size.tiny)
    table.cell(tbl, 3, 12, "ATR=" + f_n(atrPctO) + "p", text_color = wC, text_size = size.tiny)
    table.cell(tbl, 0, 13, "52wk", bgcolor = hdrBg, text_color = wC, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(tbl, 1, 13, f_n(distLoO) + "% from low", text_color = distLoO > 80 ? okC : distLoO < 20 ? color.red : wC, text_size = size.tiny)
    table.cell(tbl, 2, 13, "ROC20=" + str.tostring(roc20O, "0.#") + "%", text_color = roc20O > 0 ? okC : color.red, text_size = size.tiny)
    table.cell(tbl, 3, 13, "ROC60=" + str.tostring(roc60O, "0.#") + "%", text_color = roc60O > 0 ? okC : color.red, text_size = size.tiny)
    table.cell(tbl, 0, 14, "Market", bgcolor = hdrBg, text_color = wC, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(tbl, 1, 14, "SPY regime " + f_n(mktO), text_color = mktO >= 1 ? okC : color.red, text_size = size.tiny)
    table.cell(tbl, 2, 14, "RS 3M " + str.tostring(rs3mO, "0.#") + "% · 6M " + str.tostring(rs6mO, "0.#") + "%", text_color = rs3mO > 0 ? okC : color.red, text_size = size.tiny)
    table.cell(tbl, 3, 14, "12-1 " + str.tostring(mom121O, "0.#") + "%", text_color = mom121O > 0 ? okC : color.red, text_size = size.tiny)
    table.cell(tbl, 0, 15, "Fund / Earn", bgcolor = hdrBg, text_color = wC, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(tbl, 1, 15, "rev " + str.tostring(revO, "0.#") + "% · eps " + str.tostring(epsO, "0.#") + "% · Q " + (na(epsG0O) ? "n/a" : (epsG0O >= 0 ? "+" : "") + str.tostring(epsG0O, "0") + "%") + " accel " + (na(epsAccelO) ? "-" : f_n(epsAccelO)), text_color = fundO ? wC : noC, text_size = size.tiny)
    table.cell(tbl, 2, 15, earnKnownO ? "earnings " + f_n(dteO) + "d" : earnEstO ? "earnings ~" + f_n(dteO) + "d (est)" : "earnings n/a", text_color = (earnKnownO or earnEstO) and dteO <= 7 ? color.red : wC, text_size = size.tiny)
    table.cell(tbl, 3, 15, "ADV $" + str.tostring(advO / 1000000.0, "0.#") + "M", text_color = liqO ? okC : color.red, text_size = size.tiny)
    table.cell(tbl, 0, 16, "Sector / Breadth", bgcolor = hdrBg, text_color = wC, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(tbl, 1, 16, secOkO ? secTag + " RS 3M " + (rsSecO >= 0 ? "+" : "") + str.tostring(rsSecO, "0.#") + "% · trend " + f_n(secTrendO) : "sector n/a", text_color = secOkO ? (rsSecO > 0 ? okC : color.red) : noC, text_size = size.tiny)
    table.cell(tbl, 2, 16, breadthO ? "S&P above 50D " + f_n(s5fiO) + "% · 200D " + f_n(s5thO) + "%" : "breadth n/a", text_color = breadthO ? (s5thO >= 50 ? okC : color.red) : noC, text_size = size.tiny)
    table.cell(tbl, 3, 16, na(revG0O) ? "rev Q n/a" : "rev Q " + (revG0O >= 0 ? "+" : "") + str.tostring(revG0O, "0") + "% accel " + (na(revAccelO) ? "-" : f_n(revAccelO)), text_color = na(revG0O) ? noC : revG0O > 0 ? okC : color.red, text_size = size.tiny)
    table.cell(tbl, 0, 17, "Cooldown", bgcolor = hdrBg, text_color = wC, text_size = size.small)
    table.cell(tbl, 1, 17, "SW " + (swCoolRem > 0 ? f_n(swCoolRem) + "b" : "READY") + " · POS " + (poCoolRem > 0 ? f_n(poCoolRem) + "b" : "READY") + " · GR " + (grCoolRem > 0 ? f_n(grCoolRem) + "b" : "READY"), text_color = swCoolRem + poCoolRem + grCoolRem > 0 ? color.orange : okC, text_size = size.tiny)
    table.cell(tbl, 2, 17, (isDailyTF ? "1D ok" : "NOT 1D") + (warmO ? "" : " · WARMUP"), text_color = isDailyTF and warmO ? noC : color.red, text_size = size.tiny)
    table.cell(tbl, 3, 17, "v2.2.0", text_color = noC, text_size = size.tiny)
